Package: rOFI
Title: Compute and Visualize Order-Flow Imbalance Patterns
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dionysios", "Poniros", , "your.email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A beginner-friendly R package for computing and visualizing order-flow 
    imbalance (OFI) signals from trade-level data. Provides tools to calculate simple OFI, 
    imbalance ratios, and cumulative patterns, along with functions for simulating 
    synthetic order flow data for educational purposes.
